  "story": {
    "day": 49,
    "title": "Kaya's Lunch Break",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya was a young girl who always felt hungry after P.E.",
      "She went to her locker for food.",
      "Oh, who was that friendly girl?",
      "It was her cousin, Yumi, from elementary school!",
      "\"You're here too!\" Kaya said.",
      "Yumi had very small, beautiful fruit and a vegetable.",
      "Kaya had a white rice ball.",
      "\"Let's eat this great food!\" Yumi said.",
      "They talked about their family.",
      "\"Who's coming for New Year's Day?\" Kaya asked.",
      "\"My mom said, 'Right, or we can watch a movie.'\" Yumi replied.",
      "\"Yes, I want to see everyone!\" Kaya said."
    ]
  }
}